    "description": "1. Determine the desired root location based on damping ratio and settling time. 2. Determine the location of the zero z=-K_I/K_P by ensuring the angle at the desired root is -180 degrees. 3. Determine the gain at the desired root by evaluating vector lengths from poles and zeros.",
